= Erich Koch-Weser

Koch-Weser is our party chairman, and one of the chief architects of the Weimar Constitution. A pragmatist above all, his priority is keeping our small party relevant by holding coalitions together, even at the cost of ideological consistency.

- @broker_coalition
- @withhold_confidence
- @shuffle_leadership_action
- @root: Return to main

@broker_coalition
title: Brokering the Coalition
subtitle: Koch-Weser can smooth over tensions with our coalition partners, using his reputation as a constitutional architect and honest broker.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and (in_weimar_coalition or in_grand_coalition or ddp_in_government)
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if not ddp_in_government : We are not currently in government. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; coalition_dissent -= 1 if ddp_in_government = 1 and coalition_dissent > 0; z_relation += 5; spd_relation += 3; dvp_relation += 5; sammlung_dissent -= 3 if sammlung_dissent > 0
We have smoothed over tensions within the coalition, reassuring our partners of our commitment to stable government.
@withhold_confidence
title: Threaten to Withhold Confidence
subtitle: Koch-Weser can threaten to pull our support from the government unless our concerns are addressed - a dangerous card to play for a party our size.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and ddp_in_government
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if not ddp_in_government : We are not currently in government. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; coalition_dissent += 2; sammlung_strength += 2
Our threat has been heard. The coalition partners have taken our concerns more seriously, though the confrontation has strained relations.
@shuffle_leadership_action
title: Reassert Party Discipline
subtitle: Koch-Weser can use his authority as chairman to rein in a wing of the party that has grown too independent.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; sammlung_strength += 3; linksliberale_dissent -= 2 if linksliberale_dissent > 0; wirtschaftsflugel_dissent -= 2 if wirtschaftsflugel_dissent > 0; pazifisten_dissent -= 2 if pazifisten_dissent > 0
Koch-Weser has reminded the party's wings that unity is our only path to survival. Dissent has eased across the party, if only for now.
